    "body": "# BetterTot 0.3.1\n\nBetterTot 0.3.1 fixes autocorrect and spelling-suggestion interactions while\nthe scratchpad is unpinned.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- Clicking a macOS autocorrect or spelling suggestion displayed over the\n  editor no longer dismisses an unpinned scratchpad.\n- Text-input helper windows remain interactive without weakening normal\n  outside-click dismissal.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- macOS 13 Ventura or later.\n- Apple silicon or Intel Mac. Release artifacts are universal `arm64` and\n  `x86_64` binaries.\n\n## Installation\n\nDownload `BetterTot-0.3.1.pkg` for the standard Installer flow, or extract\n`BetterTot-0.3.1.zip` and move `BetterTot.app` to `/Applications`. Verify both\nfiles against `BetterTot-0.3.1.sha256` before installation.\n\nThe app is ad-hoc signed, the installer is unsigned, and neither artifact is\nnotarized. After verifying the SHA-256 checksum, open the package normally. If\nmacOS blocks it, use **System Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Security -> Open\nAnyway**, authenticate, and confirm **Open**. Never disable Gatekeeper globally.\n\n## Upgrade Safety\n\nQuit BetterTot before upgrading. Pads, workspace metadata, preferences, and\niCloud backups live outside the application bundle and remain available after\nreplacing or reinstalling BetterTot.\n"
